# Pomeranian / Dachshund test (#95): maps/pomdachtest.vmap, skill 2. Two
# Pomeranian Plasmagunners and a Dachshund Howitzer, all facing west, wake
# on sight. The player grabs the Sistrum Repeater and kills all three while
# strafing in long runs: bolts aimed where the player stood fly past, and
# mortar shells land on reticles the player has already left. Each burst is
# a re-aim (face) then 6 tics of strafe + fire. Ends with kills=3/3 and the
# player alive.
vsdemo 1
level 1
skill 2
seed 0
map pomdachtest

expect kills=0
goto 3 7                # Sistrum Repeater
goto 3 8                # Charge Jar
weapon 4
wait 10
# north Pomeranian, strafing south then north
face 13 10
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 10
in 6 0 -127 0 F
face 13 10
in 6 0 -127 0 F
face 13 10
in 6 0 -127 0 F
face 13 10
in 6 0 -127 0 F
face 13 10
in 6 0 -127 0 F
expect kills=1
# south Pomeranian, strafing south
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
face 13 5
in 6 0 127 0 F
expect kills=2
# Dachshund, strafing north
face 18 7
in 6 0 -127 0 F
face 18 7
in 6 0 -127 0 F
face 18 7
